WEBVTT

00:03.960 --> 00:08.130
Now, I will thrust this blade of blood
into your heart.

00:10.380 --> 00:14.170
When I do so, your transformation
into one of us will begin.

00:14.170 --> 00:15.580
Stop...

00:16.460 --> 00:18.170
Fear not.

00:18.170 --> 00:21.500
You will not cease being yourself.

00:21.750 --> 00:23.040
However...

00:25.880 --> 00:28.710
Your way of seeing the world
will simply change.

00:35.170 --> 00:36.540
It's hot!

00:36.540 --> 00:38.830
I'm burning up from the inside!

00:38.830 --> 00:40.580
It's gone!

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
Everything that's
irreplaceable to me is gone!

00:45.500 --> 00:47.380
Forget your hatred.

00:47.380 --> 00:50.580
Let's both live for the sake of God.

00:51.000 --> 00:56.750
Of all the things I can do for you,
this is the ultimate atonement.

01:16.750 --> 01:18.000
My...

01:18.630 --> 01:20.830
My life was meaningless.

01:21.580 --> 01:22.710
But...

01:23.330 --> 01:26.080
I won't let you have your way.

01:33.210 --> 01:34.710
He died.

01:34.710 --> 01:38.790
Why would he reject
Lady Ultimatia's kindness?

01:38.790 --> 01:40.500
I can't understand it.

01:40.500 --> 01:42.580
What in the world was he thinking?

01:43.080 --> 01:45.080
I was mistaken.

01:46.250 --> 01:49.790
He wasn't meant to join our bloodline.

01:50.500 --> 01:54.580
Dying here was his salvation.

01:56.170 --> 01:59.170
Hey, what was that back there?

01:59.630 --> 02:02.290
I just wanted to be
entertained by the show.

02:03.500 --> 02:04.420
Trois.

02:04.420 --> 02:05.080
Hwah?!

02:05.420 --> 02:06.500
Hwah?

02:06.830 --> 02:08.380
Let's go home.

02:08.710 --> 02:11.670
Can you carry everyone back on the wind?

02:11.670 --> 02:14.420
Flying is not all of our strong suits.

02:14.420 --> 02:16.920
B-b-b-by all means!

02:16.920 --> 02:19.670
The wind is the greatest and
most elegant mode of transportation!

02:19.670 --> 02:22.710
Especially for a woman as
b-b-beautiful as our progenitor!

02:22.710 --> 02:24.880
Th-that's what the wind says!

02:26.000 --> 02:29.750
Then please pass along
my thanks to the wind.

02:29.750 --> 02:30.540
Huh?

02:30.540 --> 02:32.750
Oh, yes. I'll tell him!

02:32.750 --> 02:34.380
Tro is so cute!

02:34.380 --> 02:40.210
Will he ever be able to talk to our
progenitor without acting like a buffoon?

02:42.460 --> 02:43.420
Hey!

02:44.540 --> 02:51.130
We have brought the world one step closer
to the one that God desires.

02:51.130 --> 02:54.960
Let us express our gratitude
to all those who have passed.

02:55.380 --> 02:57.460
Rest in peace...

02:58.630 --> 03:00.460
and farewell.

03:08.080 --> 03:10.710
Whew, would you look at that.

03:10.710 --> 03:11.960
Puru?

03:11.960 --> 03:14.000
Nothing ish here!

03:14.000 --> 03:15.920
That'sh incredible!

03:15.920 --> 03:16.790
Puru?

03:16.790 --> 03:18.210
There'sh trash!

03:18.210 --> 03:19.630
Shomeone littered!

03:19.630 --> 03:21.040
Don't touch it.

03:21.750 --> 03:25.750
I'll determine whether or not it's trash.

03:29.040 --> 03:32.880
He froze his heart and stopped himself
from becoming a member of the bloodline.

03:32.880 --> 03:37.580
A human who was given the blood
and resisted its control...

03:37.580 --> 03:39.250
Golem, carry him.

03:39.250 --> 03:40.710
We're taking him back to the base.

03:40.710 --> 03:43.330
What? You gonna dissect him?

03:43.330 --> 03:44.540
No.

03:44.540 --> 03:46.420
I'm going to revive him.

03:46.420 --> 03:49.750
He might end up being something interesting.

05:23.500 --> 05:30.170
<b>Episode 7: Act and Guilt</b>

05:24.830 --> 05:27.250
This is quite the show.

05:27.250 --> 05:28.130
Oh?

05:28.130 --> 05:30.750
What's going to happen to
the plan, Lady Vero-

05:30.750 --> 05:31.420
Damn you, damn you, damn you,

05:31.420 --> 05:32.630
Uh-oh.
Damn you, damn you, damn you,<b></b>

05:32.630 --> 05:34.710
damn you, damn you, damn you,
damn you, damn you!

05:34.710 --> 05:37.290
Damn you, you mediocre man!

05:37.290 --> 05:40.290
He deviated from my expectations!

05:40.920 --> 05:43.460
Out of the millions who live in
this stupidly large city,

05:43.460 --> 05:46.130
how the hell did you run into her?

05:46.130 --> 05:47.880
What were the odds of that?

05:48.920 --> 05:51.210
Seriously, am I cursed?

05:52.380 --> 05:53.710
Oh, well.

05:54.080 --> 05:57.710
The original point of this plan
was to assess Ragna's power.

05:57.710 --> 06:00.130
If he pulls this off,
it'll be a win all the same.

06:00.130 --> 06:02.750
If things go awry, I'll deal with it.

06:04.170 --> 06:06.750
He really is different this time around.

06:06.750 --> 06:08.330
It shouldn't be surprising.

06:09.040 --> 06:10.580
I have a report.

06:11.380 --> 06:13.630
He destroyed the second castle wall
on the south side of the Old District

06:13.630 --> 06:15.040
and entered the New District.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.880
He has the upper hand.

06:16.880 --> 06:19.540
There is no sight of
the two superior dragons.

06:20.130 --> 06:23.920
Just before the battle started,
the barrier around the capital disappeared.

06:23.920 --> 06:25.880
Is Nebulim dead?

06:25.880 --> 06:26.920
Or...

06:26.920 --> 06:28.290
Chimera, come back to me.

06:28.290 --> 06:29.210
Yes, Master.

06:29.210 --> 06:30.080
Slime.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.130
Yesh, Mashter!

06:31.130 --> 06:34.670
Go to the nearest place
that smells mouthwatering.

06:34.670 --> 06:35.960
Understood?

06:35.960 --> 06:37.040
Puru?

06:38.540 --> 06:40.460
Oh! Undershtood!

06:40.460 --> 06:42.330
Pururururu!

06:42.670 --> 06:43.830
I've got visual.

06:43.830 --> 06:46.750
Borgius has left the castle.

06:47.250 --> 06:48.130
Take him out.

06:48.130 --> 06:49.540
In this body?

06:49.540 --> 06:51.330
There's no time for you to switch.

06:51.330 --> 06:52.880
Aww!

06:52.880 --> 06:55.670
I can't use my combat body?

06:55.670 --> 06:59.830
What I can do in a normal body is limited.

07:00.750 --> 07:02.960
Killing might be impossible.

07:02.960 --> 07:04.460
You just need to stall him.

07:04.460 --> 07:05.750
After that...

07:05.750 --> 07:06.710
Hm?

07:06.710 --> 07:10.750
Fifth District, 12th Street,
number 22-7, basement.

07:10.750 --> 07:13.960
Also, the installation is finished.

07:14.830 --> 07:17.960
I just pray I won't need to use it.

07:18.330 --> 07:19.290
Go.

07:20.290 --> 07:26.380
However, all the orders I just gave
will be in vain if Ultimatia does that.

07:29.080 --> 07:33.250
Let's see if you can actually
push her that hard.

07:33.250 --> 07:35.960
Show me you can, mediocre man.

07:38.080 --> 07:40.460
Have I died too many times?

07:44.170 --> 07:48.630
Not enough time to rewind and return...

07:48.630 --> 07:52.210
I apologize for my tardiness, Progenitor.

07:52.210 --> 07:56.380
I'll absorb the blood in the castle
and fire my cannon.

07:56.380 --> 08:00.080
Please forgive me for firing
when you'll get caught up in the blast.

08:00.080 --> 08:05.040
I don't think this enemy can be taken down
with less than these drastic measures.

08:06.790 --> 08:07.750
Hmm?

08:08.540 --> 08:10.040
An ambush?

08:12.000 --> 08:14.630
You got a little too fired up there, gramps.

08:14.920 --> 08:16.880
All right, time to get outta here.

08:19.380 --> 08:21.080
So that guy is Ragna.

08:23.460 --> 08:25.630
He might actually win.

08:26.000 --> 08:26.790
Hm?

08:27.080 --> 08:28.500
Restraining Barrier!

08:28.500 --> 08:29.750
So heavy!

08:29.750 --> 08:30.880
Impossible!

08:30.880 --> 08:32.040
Nebulim!

08:32.210 --> 08:33.670
Crap.

08:33.670 --> 08:36.210
The freezing power of this enemy's
silverine is off the charts!

08:36.630 --> 08:39.790
Finally, I've progressed from
being dead to nearly dead.

08:40.710 --> 08:42.920
Hold on for just a few more seconds.

08:42.920 --> 08:44.250
But...

08:44.920 --> 08:46.580
That's enough!

08:46.580 --> 08:50.250
I just need to buy enough time
for Lady Ultimatia!

08:50.460 --> 08:52.000
Nebulim.

08:52.000 --> 08:56.130
I'm deeply grateful, relieved, and sad.

08:56.130 --> 08:59.580
Ready to rewind 3.1 seconds.

09:00.040 --> 09:01.540
One more push.

09:01.540 --> 09:03.460
For good measure, I'll use...

09:04.000 --> 09:09.170
the gushing, repulsive life force
of my blood.

09:09.170 --> 09:10.460
I'll engulf him...

09:14.210 --> 09:16.170
Silverine Full Power!

09:18.290 --> 09:19.170
No!

09:19.170 --> 09:21.330
I gotta hold on one more second!

09:21.330 --> 09:23.040
I'll sacrifice my life!

09:23.460 --> 09:26.380
Just hold on, and then I can die!

09:29.380 --> 09:31.880
Rewind is complete.

09:31.880 --> 09:34.000
Thank you, Nebulim.

09:34.000 --> 09:36.170
Now, let's put an end to this.

09:36.670 --> 09:38.330
Heed me, creation...

09:38.920 --> 09:40.210
and fall sti-

09:40.210 --> 09:41.670
Silverine Flight.

09:56.130 --> 09:57.540
Honestly...

09:58.040 --> 10:00.790
you're pretty wimpy for a dragon monarch.

10:00.790 --> 10:03.670
Why am I thinking of you now?

10:03.670 --> 10:05.040
How unpleasant.

10:05.540 --> 10:10.670
It takes you one to two tenths of
a second for you to stop time.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.330
That's too long.

10:12.330 --> 10:14.500
We live in a world where
less than one tenth of a second

10:14.500 --> 10:17.040
is the difference between killing
and being killed.

10:17.040 --> 10:21.040
Who is the "we" you speak of?

10:21.040 --> 10:22.920
It's not obvious?

10:22.920 --> 10:28.000
That's me and anyone else
who's attained an insane level of power.

10:36.000 --> 10:37.830
We're outside the capital.

10:38.380 --> 10:41.710
I don't need to hold back any longer.

10:41.710 --> 10:45.630
If you end up battling someone like that,

10:45.630 --> 10:47.670
you'll want me there to have your back.

10:48.500 --> 10:50.420
But if I'm not...

10:51.330 --> 10:53.580
don't hesitate to play your trump card.

10:54.420 --> 10:58.000
Use the foolproof trick
you've got up your sleeve.

10:58.000 --> 11:00.670
You must remember it and carry it out.

11:01.420 --> 11:04.290
H... eed... me...

11:05.580 --> 11:08.580
Heed me, all creation, and return.

11:21.540 --> 11:23.670
We give you our word!

11:23.920 --> 11:28.330
We shall exterminate every last vermin
that bares its fangs against our homeland!

11:28.330 --> 11:32.580
We shall restore peace
to the lives of our people!

11:35.790 --> 11:38.380
Long live Lese! Long live Lese!

11:46.170 --> 11:48.750
Theshe shtupid humansh are
getting way too carried away.

11:48.750 --> 11:52.500
I could gobble up thish crowd
in shishxty shecondsh flat!

11:53.290 --> 11:54.580
This feels weird.

11:54.580 --> 11:56.130
Something's off, but what?

11:56.130 --> 11:57.750
This is definitely wrong.

11:57.750 --> 11:59.460
What is it? This is bad.

11:59.460 --> 12:02.080
I need to do something.
But what? Figure it out!

12:02.080 --> 12:03.630
Hurry, before it's too la-

12:04.500 --> 12:06.330
I've already stopped time.

12:07.250 --> 12:13.750
It takes such a colossal amount of magic
to rewind the world that it's rarely done.

12:14.170 --> 12:18.040
But you're enough of a threat that I had to.

12:18.630 --> 12:21.460
Enough of a threat that I felt
death closing in on me.

12:22.580 --> 12:24.210
That being said,

12:24.210 --> 12:26.500
the battle is over.

12:27.170 --> 12:28.540
Actually,

12:28.540 --> 12:32.040
the battle hasn't even taken place yet.

12:32.630 --> 12:38.380
Now, how shall I deal with you?

12:40.080 --> 12:43.250
I wonder who you were, after all.

12:43.710 --> 12:48.130
Your deep hatred of me was apparent.

12:48.460 --> 12:52.500
So when did I incur your hatred?

12:53.290 --> 12:57.920
I would like to know,
but I don't think I ever shall.

12:58.630 --> 13:04.040
For it is in this inert world
that you will look death in the eyes.

13:15.000 --> 13:16.830
There we go.

13:17.710 --> 13:23.000
I wouldn't stoop to cruelly killing
even someone who scorns God.

13:23.630 --> 13:26.830
When I had a shortage of brain matter,

13:26.830 --> 13:30.830
you were considerate towards
the people and fought for their sake.

13:31.420 --> 13:32.960
Incidentally,

13:32.960 --> 13:35.500
who is that child?

13:35.500 --> 13:38.460
You must know each other,

13:38.460 --> 13:40.630
but maybe it would be best to remove hi-

13:43.130 --> 13:45.880
Did he move just now?

13:45.880 --> 13:48.170
No, that's impossible!

13:48.170 --> 13:50.580
I didn't feel time snapping back.

13:50.830 --> 13:52.830
He simply cannot be able to move.

13:54.210 --> 13:56.040
Was it my imagination?

14:00.040 --> 14:01.420
Nebulim?

14:03.920 --> 14:06.460
How dare you.

14:07.830 --> 14:09.290
How dare you!

14:09.290 --> 14:12.290
How dare you! How dare you!
How dare you! How dare you!

14:14.080 --> 14:16.290
He's not moving.

14:16.960 --> 14:18.830
So it was just my imagination after all.

14:18.830 --> 14:20.250
Thank goodness.

14:20.250 --> 14:22.420
That is such a relief.

14:22.420 --> 14:26.170
As the progenitor, I can't allow
such things to happen.

14:27.380 --> 14:29.540
You can stop now, Nebulim.

14:31.210 --> 14:33.670
Look at your arms.

14:36.580 --> 14:41.540
That liquid seems to be an acid
that melts our bodies.

14:41.540 --> 14:44.880
It appears that is the child's true nature.

14:45.460 --> 14:49.380
It will harm us if we inadvertently touch it.

14:49.380 --> 14:52.040
But the enemy is still...

14:52.040 --> 14:53.830
I know.

14:53.830 --> 14:58.130
I tested out various things
during the battle earlier.

14:58.500 --> 15:01.210
He broke through each of my defenses,

15:01.210 --> 15:04.040
and my attacks were ineffective.

15:06.000 --> 15:11.210
Even now, you've beat him up so badly,
but none of his wounds are fatal.

15:11.210 --> 15:15.630
It's as if his body is a powerful silver sword.

15:15.630 --> 15:18.750
He's not currently shrouded in silverine,

15:18.750 --> 15:22.000
but I believe the source of his power
is within his body.

15:22.880 --> 15:25.880
This power is incredibly resistant to magic,

15:25.880 --> 15:30.000
and it appears only a magic with
world-shattering power would be effective.

15:30.500 --> 15:32.750
Since we are weakened by sunlight,

15:32.750 --> 15:36.250
I think inflicting a fatal injury upon him
would be challenging.

15:36.250 --> 15:38.500
We need to use a different method.

15:38.960 --> 15:41.130
Elder, can you hear me?

15:41.130 --> 15:43.750
I can hear you, my Progenitor.

15:44.170 --> 15:46.460
I have a message I'd like you to deliver.

15:46.460 --> 15:49.000
A message? To whom?

15:49.330 --> 15:55.670
There are three individuals I've permitted
to move in this unstirring world.

15:55.670 --> 15:57.830
You and Nebulim are two of them.

15:57.830 --> 15:59.670
And the third is...

15:59.670 --> 16:01.670
King Femud Lese.

16:02.170 --> 16:04.380
I have a request for him.

16:04.830 --> 16:09.080
I want him to fire the "light" at that man.

16:11.330 --> 16:15.290
I expect that the barrier's offensive function

16:15.290 --> 16:20.250
will be much more effective
than a magical attack.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.460
Understood.

16:22.460 --> 16:24.830
But I have just one word of warning.

16:24.830 --> 16:29.920
There is at least one more
enemy present besides this man.

16:30.380 --> 16:35.040
Then we shall find his allies
after we're done with him.

16:35.790 --> 16:38.080
We can no longer be careless.

16:40.540 --> 16:44.250
Nebulim, it will be dangerous,
so let's move away.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.960
Lady Ultimatia.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.380
I...

16:48.500 --> 16:52.540
I will always depend upon you.

16:52.540 --> 16:55.210
What lies ahead won't change that.

16:55.580 --> 16:59.880
For the time being,
I ask that you first put up a barrier

16:59.880 --> 17:02.380
to protect the people
in the surrounding area.

17:02.380 --> 17:06.330
The light's attack range might go
beyond what I anticipate.

17:16.170 --> 17:17.790
It's odd.

17:17.790 --> 17:22.210
Even though I know he's an enemy now,
I feel a bit of affection for him.

17:23.290 --> 17:27.750
It's like a diluted version of what I feel
for those in my bloodline.

17:28.080 --> 17:33.130
When he's killed so many of us,
it's disloyal of me to feel that way.

17:33.960 --> 17:36.750
I'll forget that feeling when you die.

17:38.540 --> 17:41.130
May your death be painless and peaceful.

17:41.500 --> 17:42.790
Farewell.

17:44.830 --> 17:49.000
Now, I will thrust this blade of blood
into your heart.

17:56.170 --> 18:00.170
You... won't... get... away.

18:00.500 --> 18:01.380
Huh?

18:01.540 --> 18:03.330
You won't get...

18:03.630 --> 18:05.790
another single second!

18:08.380 --> 18:13.540
I won't... let you... live!

18:16.250 --> 18:17.500
He's moving?

18:17.500 --> 18:18.750
He's coming at me?

18:18.750 --> 18:20.830
He's moving slower than before.

18:20.830 --> 18:22.670
I can follow his movements.

18:22.670 --> 18:24.920
But he's moving!

18:25.380 --> 18:26.880
Please stay back!

18:29.670 --> 18:30.830
Lady Ultimatia!

18:31.080 --> 18:35.460
My Time Control Magic
is only slightly working?

18:36.130 --> 18:38.960
Right now, outside of King Lese,
the only people in the world

18:38.960 --> 18:42.830
who I've allowed to move
are others who share my blood!

18:43.130 --> 18:45.670
The following is not a weakness,

18:45.670 --> 18:48.080
but an overwhelming advantage
of Time Control Magic.

18:48.080 --> 18:53.040
You can choose to exempt people from
the effects of stopping and rewinding time.

18:53.330 --> 19:00.380
Generally, you'd choose to exclude
members of your own bloodline.

19:00.670 --> 19:03.420
But perhaps you'll benefit from that.

19:03.880 --> 19:06.170
You cannot move unless
I give you permission!

19:09.040 --> 19:10.750
Enhanced Protective Barrier!

19:11.080 --> 19:14.920
Now I've put up the best protective
measure I can conceive of!

19:15.210 --> 19:19.670
I'll never again let Lady Ultimatia get hurt!

19:27.880 --> 19:30.170
Are you scared of me?

19:33.460 --> 19:37.330
With all the deaths on your hands...

19:38.630 --> 19:44.500
how dare you cower at your own!

19:50.290 --> 19:52.290
Heed me, time, and return!

19:57.580 --> 19:59.250
How can this be?

19:59.670 --> 20:01.420
Time has been rewound,

20:01.420 --> 20:03.960
yet it's moving again.

20:08.880 --> 20:10.960
I could rewind the world again,
but then what would I do?

20:10.960 --> 20:13.040
First, should I stop time?

20:13.040 --> 20:16.170
Even if I stop it, it won't stop completely.

20:16.170 --> 20:18.880
What should I do? What can I do?

20:18.880 --> 20:21.710
It won't be long until I die
and can't return.

20:21.710 --> 20:24.500
I'll die! I can't die now!

20:24.500 --> 20:26.040
Kamui!

20:26.040 --> 20:27.880
Why aren't you here?

20:39.130 --> 20:41.250
Everything looks red.

20:41.790 --> 20:44.420
It hurts. I can't breathe.

20:45.630 --> 20:47.790
Have I been damaged too much?

20:47.790 --> 20:49.330
That's not it.

20:49.330 --> 20:51.000
These are...

20:51.000 --> 20:55.080
the repercussions of using
too much of my future power.

20:57.710 --> 20:59.080
Damn it.

21:05.130 --> 21:07.380
Protect our progenitor, Nebulim!

21:11.130 --> 21:13.130
Begone!

21:13.790 --> 21:16.000
Aurora Beam!

21:24.130 --> 21:26.170
Ah, my eyes! I can't see!

21:26.170 --> 21:27.080
Smoke?

21:27.080 --> 21:29.210
What in the world is going on?

21:30.580 --> 21:33.000
How did it go, Nebulim?
Did we take him out?

21:33.380 --> 21:35.000
No, Elder.

21:35.880 --> 21:37.710
There are new enemies.

21:38.210 --> 21:39.670
What's that?

21:39.670 --> 21:41.380
A huge cat?

21:41.380 --> 21:42.750
And...

21:42.750 --> 21:44.790
A human woman?

21:44.790 --> 21:46.290
I can't see her face!

21:46.290 --> 21:49.580
They may not be the only enemies, Nebulim!

21:50.040 --> 21:51.210
Progenitor!

21:51.210 --> 21:53.710
